1
00:00:10,360 --> 00:00:12,630
♪Wealth fades away, fame fades away♪

2
00:00:13,640 --> 00:00:16,790
♪All worldly pursuits
are fleeting dreams♪

3
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:19,350
♪Sorrow fades away,
resentment fades away♪

4
00:00:20,100 --> 00:00:22,870
♪Anger and grudges are
but passing clouds♪

5
00:00:23,480 --> 00:00:26,640
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

6
00:00:26,730 --> 00:00:30,150
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

7
00:00:34,880 --> 00:00:37,230
♪This humble monk wanders freely
across the land♪

8
00:00:38,160 --> 00:00:40,430
♪Laughing and fooling around,
yet bound by karma's law♪

9
00:00:41,240 --> 00:00:43,950
♪People spend their lives chasing
fortune and fearing misfortune♪

10
00:00:44,640 --> 00:00:47,110
♪Yet in a blink, all return to dust♪

11
00:00:47,920 --> 00:00:50,230
♪They scheme endlessly in pursuit
of wealth and glory♪

12
00:00:51,200 --> 00:00:53,580
♪But in the end, all things
simply pass by♪

13
00:00:54,440 --> 00:00:57,350
♪Better to follow the heart
and find true joy♪

14
00:00:57,640 --> 00:01:00,550
♪Don't let worldly troubles
bind your soul♪

15
00:01:00,880 --> 00:01:02,190
♪Walk on, walk on♪

16
00:01:02,560 --> 00:01:03,870
♪Roam on, roam on♪

17
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:07,430
♪With my worn-out fan in hand,
I care not for worldly woes♪

18
00:01:07,440 --> 00:01:08,750
♪Drink some wine♪

19
00:01:09,120 --> 00:01:10,510
♪Sail the rivers wide♪

20
00:01:10,520 --> 00:01:13,910
♪Simple robes and straw sandals
beat fine silk and fur♪

21
00:01:13,920 --> 00:01:17,070
♪Laugh at my carefree ways, a simple
fan is all I need to chase worries away♪

22
00:01:17,080 --> 00:01:20,470
♪Laugh at my shabby look, a half pot
of wine carries me through the years♪

23
00:01:20,480 --> 00:01:23,750
♪Wine and meat may pass through me,
but kindness stays in my heart♪

24
00:01:23,760 --> 00:01:27,030
♪I cling not to appearances,
finding freedom through Zen's wisdom♪

25
00:01:27,040 --> 00:01:29,070
♪I travel north and south,
witnessing the world's endless tales♪

26
00:01:29,880 --> 00:01:32,540
♪I see life's joys and sorrows
in a single glance♪

27
00:01:33,080 --> 00:01:36,150
♪Those who harm the good and abuse
their power will face their reckoning♪

28
00:01:36,160 --> 00:01:39,630
♪Do good and cultivate virtue,
and worries will fade away♪

29
00:01:39,640 --> 00:01:41,990
♪Don't frown over gains and losses♪

30
00:01:42,240 --> 00:01:45,750
♪True cultivation lies
in a joyful heart♪

31
00:01:46,120 --> 00:01:48,870
♪Let right and wrong, love and hatred
drift away with the wind♪

32
00:01:48,880 --> 00:01:52,990
♪Live freely and wander this world
without restraint♪

33
00:01:53,780 --> 00:01:56,380
=The Mad Monk: Subdue Demons of Dragon's Fall=
=Episode 9=

34
00:01:57,540 --> 00:01:58,260
Piaopiao.

35
00:01:58,700 --> 00:01:59,500
Wow!

36
00:01:59,980 --> 00:02:01,420
What kind of technique
is Mr. Huang Jr. practicing?

37
00:02:02,060 --> 00:02:02,740
Holy Monk.

38
00:02:02,980 --> 00:02:04,140
He did it to save me.

39
00:02:04,140 --> 00:02:05,180
Please heal his injuries quickly.

40
00:02:05,180 --> 00:02:05,860
Wait, wait.

41
00:02:05,860 --> 00:02:07,700
Let me get the full story first.

42
00:02:08,700 --> 00:02:09,140
Hey, hey.

43
00:02:09,540 --> 00:02:10,100
Wow!

44
00:02:10,100 --> 00:02:11,660
So you're an evil Taoist!

45
00:02:11,820 --> 00:02:13,220
No, no, I...

46
00:02:13,220 --> 00:02:13,700
Miss.

47
00:02:14,780 --> 00:02:15,260
Miss.

48
00:02:15,380 --> 00:02:16,260
I don't know him.

49
00:02:16,260 --> 00:02:17,580
You little brat!

50
00:02:17,580 --> 00:02:18,380
Enough nonsense.

51
00:02:18,620 --> 00:02:19,300
Holy Monk.

52
00:02:19,460 --> 00:02:20,220
Hurry and subdue him.

53
00:02:20,220 --> 00:02:20,980
Subdue him?

54
00:02:21,220 --> 00:02:22,100
Subdue him! Subdue him!

55
00:02:22,100 --> 00:02:22,540
Okay.

56
00:02:22,660 --> 00:02:26,540
Alright, I'll just slowly
pick up my gourd.

57
00:02:26,540 --> 00:02:28,540
Then I'll seal you inside it.

58
00:02:28,540 --> 00:02:29,260
But

59
00:02:29,260 --> 00:02:31,460
a monk can't go around fighting
and killing every day.

60
00:02:31,460 --> 00:02:33,340
Everything can be talked out.

61
00:02:33,340 --> 00:02:34,380
Talk it out?

62
00:02:34,740 --> 00:02:36,420
Water flows downward.

63
00:02:36,420 --> 00:02:37,460
People strive upward.

64
00:02:37,460 --> 00:02:37,940
Right.

65
00:02:37,940 --> 00:02:39,020
I'm just an ordinary mortal.

66
00:02:39,020 --> 00:02:40,380
I want eternal life.

67
00:02:40,380 --> 00:02:41,580
What's wrong with that?

68
00:02:41,780 --> 00:02:43,620
You're absolutely right.

69
00:02:43,620 --> 00:02:44,140
Yes.

70
00:02:44,500 --> 00:02:45,020
Thanks.

71
00:02:45,500 --> 00:02:45,940
Holy Monk.

72
00:02:45,940 --> 00:02:46,300
Yes?

73
00:02:46,540 --> 00:02:47,980
Isn't Lingyin Temple short on money?

74
00:02:48,220 --> 00:02:48,540
Yes.

75
00:02:49,060 --> 00:02:51,620
If you spare me,

76
00:02:51,620 --> 00:02:53,340
I'll donate all my wealth

77
00:02:53,340 --> 00:02:54,820
to Lingyin Temple.

78
00:02:54,820 --> 00:02:56,460
Oh? Such a good deal?

79
00:02:56,460 --> 00:02:57,340
Well, I won't say no to that.

80
00:02:57,340 --> 00:03:00,020
Sign it right away.

81
00:03:02,740 --> 00:03:03,940
What are you doing?

82
00:03:04,860 --> 00:03:05,820
Holy Monk.

83
00:03:06,140 --> 00:03:07,340
Please save me.

84
00:03:07,700 --> 00:03:08,940
It really hurts.

85
00:03:09,660 --> 00:03:10,140
Oh.

86
00:03:10,140 --> 00:03:11,340
In the world of love,

87
00:03:11,340 --> 00:03:12,620
pain is unavoidable.

88
00:03:12,620 --> 00:03:13,780
Just bear with it.

89
00:03:14,300 --> 00:03:14,700
You...

90
00:03:14,820 --> 00:03:16,460
What on earth are you doing?

91
00:03:16,820 --> 00:03:17,260
Ah...

92
00:03:17,260 --> 00:03:18,420
Go, go!

93
00:03:21,460 --> 00:03:22,740
Master has no spiritual power right now.

94
00:03:22,740 --> 00:03:23,820
If that guy gets angry,

95
00:03:23,820 --> 00:03:25,060
none of us can beat him.

96
00:03:26,500 --> 00:03:27,340
Die.

97
00:03:27,660 --> 00:03:29,420
What are you whispering about?

98
00:03:29,780 --> 00:03:31,140
I'm really in pain.

99
00:03:31,300 --> 00:03:32,260
Please save me!

100
00:03:32,260 --> 00:03:33,620
If you can't even
endure this little pain,

101
00:03:33,620 --> 00:03:34,500
then I was wrong about you.

102
00:03:35,780 --> 00:03:36,300
Come on.

103
00:03:36,300 --> 00:03:37,100
You've been staring for so long.

104
00:03:37,100 --> 00:03:38,380
Hurry up and sign it.

105
00:03:39,980 --> 00:03:41,220
(Contract: Huang agrees to donate
all his property to Lingyin Temple.)

106
00:03:42,340 --> 00:03:42,820
Wait.

107
00:03:42,820 --> 00:03:43,260
Huh?

108
00:03:45,700 --> 00:03:46,260
Hold on.

109
00:03:47,220 --> 00:03:49,020
What if I leave my fingerprint,

110
00:03:49,300 --> 00:03:50,780
and then you kill me to cover it up?

111
00:03:51,220 --> 00:03:53,060
Wouldn't all my property
end up belonging to you?

112
00:03:53,060 --> 00:03:53,620
Well...

113
00:03:53,620 --> 00:03:55,020
That's easy.

114
00:03:55,460 --> 00:03:56,780
If I really killed you,

115
00:03:56,780 --> 00:03:58,100
just take that document

116
00:03:58,100 --> 00:03:59,860
and report me to the authorities.

117
00:03:59,860 --> 00:04:00,500
Oh, right.

118
00:04:00,940 --> 00:04:01,380
Wait, no.

119
00:04:01,540 --> 00:04:02,020
Huh?

120
00:04:02,380 --> 00:04:03,100
Come on.

121
00:04:03,100 --> 00:04:04,460
Do you think I'm stupid?

122
00:04:04,820 --> 00:04:06,060
If you kill me,

123
00:04:06,060 --> 00:04:07,300
how am I supposed to report you?

124
00:04:07,380 --> 00:04:07,740
Huh?

125
00:04:07,900 --> 00:04:09,260
That's true.

126
00:04:09,260 --> 00:04:10,060
Good point.

127
00:04:10,260 --> 00:04:10,700
Then how about this?

128
00:04:11,020 --> 00:04:11,940
I swear to Heaven,

129
00:04:11,940 --> 00:04:14,100
as long as you truly
turn over a new leaf,

130
00:04:14,100 --> 00:04:16,060
if I ever kill you,

131
00:04:16,060 --> 00:04:17,620
may Heaven strike me with thunder,

132
00:04:17,620 --> 00:04:18,860
and may I never find redemption.

133
00:04:18,860 --> 00:04:19,780
Will that do?

134
00:04:19,980 --> 00:04:20,740
Well,

135
00:04:20,740 --> 00:04:21,820
you agreed so quickly.

136
00:04:22,220 --> 00:04:22,660
Fine.

137
00:04:22,860 --> 00:04:23,620
I'll trust you this once.

138
00:04:25,340 --> 00:04:25,780
Here.

139
00:04:28,180 --> 00:04:28,860
Good.

140
00:04:29,420 --> 00:04:30,340
Pleasure doing business with you.

141
00:04:32,380 --> 00:04:33,460
Well, Holy Monk...

142
00:04:33,780 --> 00:04:34,220
I, uh...

143
00:04:34,220 --> 00:04:36,300
I just have one tiny little request.

144
00:04:36,420 --> 00:04:36,700
Huh?

145
00:04:36,700 --> 00:04:37,260
Another one?

146
00:04:37,620 --> 00:04:39,140
Could you help me

147
00:04:39,460 --> 00:04:41,100
ascend to immortality?

148
00:04:41,100 --> 00:04:41,780
Oh.

149
00:04:42,380 --> 00:04:43,620
All things possess spiritual potential.

150
00:04:43,620 --> 00:04:45,820
As long as you put down the butcher's
knife and follow the righteous path,

151
00:04:46,340 --> 00:04:48,860
you will eventually attain
enlightenment.

152
00:04:49,580 --> 00:04:49,980
Father.

153
00:04:50,180 --> 00:04:51,460
When you become an immortal,
take me with you.

154
00:04:51,460 --> 00:04:52,300
Get lost.

155
00:04:52,740 --> 00:04:53,140
Right, right.

156
00:04:53,660 --> 00:04:56,020
After I become an immortal,

157
00:04:56,340 --> 00:04:57,340
I'll need your help, Holy Monk,

158
00:04:57,340 --> 00:04:59,500
to get me a residence within
the Heaven's prime district,

159
00:04:59,500 --> 00:05:00,580
and register me as a celestial resident.

160
00:05:01,060 --> 00:05:03,580
Then give me a grand palace.

161
00:05:03,900 --> 00:05:04,420
Huh?

162
00:05:04,740 --> 00:05:06,220
There is only so much I can tolerate.

163
00:05:06,820 --> 00:05:07,780
Master, hold it in.

164
00:05:07,780 --> 00:05:08,340
Fine.

165
00:05:09,660 --> 00:05:11,900
Since you like things so big,

166
00:05:12,100 --> 00:05:15,660
I'll give you the Hall
of Miraculous Mist. How about that?

167
00:05:15,660 --> 00:05:16,380
Wow!

168
00:05:16,900 --> 00:05:18,260
Sure, sure.

169
00:05:19,020 --> 00:05:19,900
You... you...

170
00:05:19,900 --> 00:05:20,740
But...

171
00:05:20,860 --> 00:05:21,660
With

172
00:05:21,660 --> 00:05:23,380
such a huge palace,

173
00:05:23,380 --> 00:05:24,700
don't you think I'd be lonely

174
00:05:25,180 --> 00:05:26,980
living there alone?

175
00:05:26,980 --> 00:05:27,940
So empty.

176
00:05:27,940 --> 00:05:30,740
How about you also help me
arrange some beautiful fairies

177
00:05:30,740 --> 00:05:32,940
to attend to me and serve me?

178
00:05:33,060 --> 00:05:33,740
Wow, he really is...

179
00:05:33,740 --> 00:05:36,220
- Never satisfied.
- Master.

180
00:05:36,220 --> 00:05:37,180
Consider it arranged.

181
00:05:37,740 --> 00:05:38,540
We'll arrange it.

182
00:05:40,220 --> 00:05:40,740
Yes.

183
00:05:41,740 --> 00:05:42,980
Arranged.

184
00:05:42,980 --> 00:05:45,540
I'll even give you the Jade Emperor's
finest royal garden as part of the deal.

185
00:05:45,540 --> 00:05:46,540
That should be enough, right?

186
00:05:46,540 --> 00:05:48,060
Alright, alright.

187
00:05:48,060 --> 00:05:48,860
Come on, come on.

188
00:05:48,860 --> 00:05:49,780
That's enough for today.

189
00:05:49,780 --> 00:05:50,660
Let's go, let's go.

190
00:05:51,140 --> 00:05:51,940
Come on, let's go.

191
00:05:51,940 --> 00:05:52,660
Go. Go.

192
00:05:52,660 --> 00:05:53,620
Oh, my...

193
00:05:53,620 --> 00:05:54,780
Wait for me!

194
00:05:55,780 --> 00:05:56,380
Come on, let's go.

195
00:06:03,180 --> 00:06:04,380
Hurry.

196
00:06:07,020 --> 00:06:07,740
You rotten monk.

197
00:06:07,740 --> 00:06:08,860
You think you deserve
to become an immortal?

198
00:06:09,260 --> 00:06:10,940
You're actually working
with that evil Taoist.

199
00:06:11,260 --> 00:06:11,700
Who is she?

200
00:06:12,620 --> 00:06:14,460
She's the Taoist who framed us before.

201
00:06:14,460 --> 00:06:16,060
She's also Mr. Huang Jr.'s mother.

202
00:06:16,060 --> 00:06:16,860
- Oh wow.
- Huh?

203
00:06:17,140 --> 00:06:18,620
You've really got a lot of identities.

204
00:06:20,460 --> 00:06:21,020
Mother?

205
00:06:26,820 --> 00:06:27,420
Mother.

206
00:06:32,500 --> 00:06:33,260
Are you alright?

207
00:06:34,060 --> 00:06:34,660
How are you feeling?

208
00:06:37,700 --> 00:06:38,260
Mother.

209
00:06:38,820 --> 00:06:39,900
I'm much better now.

210
00:06:41,580 --> 00:06:42,260
Don't be afraid.

211
00:06:43,180 --> 00:06:44,980
I'll kill that evil Taoist right now

212
00:06:45,620 --> 00:06:46,500
and avenge your father.

213
00:06:46,500 --> 00:06:48,100
You?

214
00:06:49,380 --> 00:06:51,300
(Treasures Bestowed by Heaven)
You actually dare come back to die?

215
00:06:53,020 --> 00:06:55,060
I've already absorbed
the fox clan's power.

216
00:06:56,020 --> 00:06:57,860
Prepare to meet your end.

217
00:06:59,300 --> 00:07:00,620
Please spare me.

218
00:07:01,380 --> 00:07:02,860
Father, don't you have a contract?

219
00:07:02,860 --> 00:07:03,940
Show it to her.

220
00:07:04,340 --> 00:07:05,140
Oh, right, right.

221
00:07:07,380 --> 00:07:10,100
The Holy Monk has promised
to help me become immortal.

222
00:07:11,100 --> 00:07:12,260
If you try to stop me,

223
00:07:12,260 --> 00:07:14,020
the Holy Monk won't let you
get away with it.

224
00:07:15,900 --> 00:07:17,420
You filthy monk!

225
00:07:17,580 --> 00:07:18,900
You want to stand up for him?

226
00:07:19,300 --> 00:07:20,540
I never said that.

227
00:07:20,540 --> 00:07:21,740
I will kill you first.

228
00:07:25,420 --> 00:07:26,420
Master.

229
00:07:26,700 --> 00:07:27,660
Master, are you alright?

230
00:07:27,660 --> 00:07:28,300
I'm fine.

231
00:07:28,700 --> 00:07:30,180
You fool monk.

232
00:07:30,420 --> 00:07:32,300
You don't even have a trace
of spiritual power.

233
00:07:32,740 --> 00:07:34,420
And you still dare to act tough.

234
00:07:36,300 --> 00:07:37,580
Come on.

235
00:07:37,580 --> 00:07:39,220
I finally managed to fool him.

236
00:07:39,380 --> 00:07:40,420
We're doomed now.

237
00:07:40,420 --> 00:07:42,420
It's over.

238
00:07:42,420 --> 00:07:43,940
So you don't have any spiritual power.

239
00:07:44,060 --> 00:07:44,820
Then just now...

240
00:07:45,340 --> 00:07:45,620
You...

241
00:07:46,060 --> 00:07:47,380
You lied to me!

242
00:07:47,380 --> 00:07:48,460
Don't be angry.

243
00:07:48,460 --> 00:07:49,820
I was just joking.

244
00:07:50,180 --> 00:07:51,940
Evil Taoist, prepare to die!

245
00:07:56,740 --> 00:07:57,180
Mother!

246
00:07:57,900 --> 00:07:59,300
Let him go!

247
00:08:01,820 --> 00:08:02,460
Mother!

248
00:08:05,140 --> 00:08:06,020
You filthy monk.

249
00:08:06,140 --> 00:08:07,140
How dare you deceive me!

250
00:08:07,300 --> 00:08:07,620
Hey.

251
00:08:07,860 --> 00:08:08,820
What are you trying to do?

252
00:08:09,020 --> 00:08:11,420
I'll drain all the spiritual power
from these two.

253
00:08:11,420 --> 00:08:13,780
Then I'll become immortal myself!

254
00:08:14,220 --> 00:08:15,180
Don't do anything rash!

255
00:08:15,180 --> 00:08:16,020
Let him go right now!

256
00:08:19,820 --> 00:08:20,380
Die.

257
00:08:21,740 --> 00:08:22,660
Let her go!

258
00:08:24,660 --> 00:08:26,180
Let her go!

259
00:08:28,380 --> 00:08:29,220
Mr. Huang Jr.

260
00:08:31,580 --> 00:08:32,380
Son!

261
00:08:33,860 --> 00:08:35,260
I'll kill you!

262
00:08:45,580 --> 00:08:46,300
Son!

263
00:08:48,460 --> 00:08:49,260
Son!

264
00:08:51,500 --> 00:08:52,300
Die!

265
00:08:52,940 --> 00:08:53,420
Die!

266
00:08:54,620 --> 00:08:55,220
Die!

267
00:08:55,220 --> 00:08:56,100
Ugh.

268
00:08:56,100 --> 00:08:57,660
That's useless!

269
00:09:09,580 --> 00:09:10,140
Die!

270
00:09:10,980 --> 00:09:11,940
In this life,

271
00:09:13,020 --> 00:09:14,260
I have no regrets...

272
00:09:27,460 --> 00:09:28,820
My boy!

273
00:09:32,300 --> 00:09:32,900
Wow!

274
00:09:36,980 --> 00:09:37,580
Huh?

275
00:09:39,020 --> 00:09:39,780
How could this happen?

276
00:09:39,780 --> 00:09:40,340
Huh?

277
00:09:40,980 --> 00:09:41,620
Son!

278
00:09:43,300 --> 00:09:44,060
Son!

279
00:09:44,780 --> 00:09:46,940
You absorbed the demon's power.

280
00:09:47,420 --> 00:09:49,340
You'll surely fall into darkness.

281
00:09:49,900 --> 00:09:51,900
You brought it upon yourself!

282
00:09:54,020 --> 00:09:54,620
Monk.

283
00:09:56,860 --> 00:09:59,620
If I devour you, the reincarnation
of a living Buddha,

284
00:10:00,260 --> 00:10:02,100
I can still become immortal!

285
00:10:03,060 --> 00:10:03,820
Where do you think you're going?

286
00:10:03,820 --> 00:10:04,540
Hey, wait!

287
00:10:04,540 --> 00:10:05,740
Wait!

288
00:10:06,180 --> 00:10:07,380
You really insist on eating me,
don't you?

289
00:10:08,700 --> 00:10:09,900
Only by devouring you

290
00:10:10,700 --> 00:10:12,220
can I become immortal.

291
00:10:13,140 --> 00:10:15,140
If I don't go to hell, who will?

292
00:10:15,140 --> 00:10:15,500
Come on!

293
00:10:15,540 --> 00:10:16,940
Start with my dead skin!

294
00:10:17,060 --> 00:10:17,900
Dead skin is still part of me.

295
00:10:17,900 --> 00:10:18,300
Go ahead.

296
00:10:18,500 --> 00:10:19,620
I'll eat you!

297
00:10:19,820 --> 00:10:20,820
Ah!

298
00:10:22,820 --> 00:10:23,660
Master.

299
00:10:25,020 --> 00:10:26,260
No!

300
00:10:26,340 --> 00:10:27,380
Master.

301
00:10:28,020 --> 00:10:29,020
Thunder God!

302
00:10:29,020 --> 00:10:31,060
I'm eating meat!

303
00:10:40,860 --> 00:10:41,940
Su Ling'er.

304
00:10:42,740 --> 00:10:44,140
Kill him now!

305
00:10:56,220 --> 00:10:57,820
Which kind-hearted celestial maiden
are you?

306
00:10:58,460 --> 00:11:00,220
May I have the honor
of knowing your name?

307
00:11:10,460 --> 00:11:11,140
Hey, savior.

308
00:11:11,500 --> 00:11:13,180
Why did it take you so many days
to come back?

309
00:11:13,740 --> 00:11:14,740
Something unexpected happened.

310
00:11:15,020 --> 00:11:16,540
But luckily, I got the greedy heart.

311
00:11:16,820 --> 00:11:17,580
Hurry and eat it.

312
00:11:19,580 --> 00:11:21,020
I can tell it's a bad person.

313
00:11:21,140 --> 00:11:22,580
This heart reeks of corruption.

314
00:11:22,580 --> 00:11:23,820
It's hard to even open my mouth.

315
00:11:23,820 --> 00:11:24,900
Hey, do you have any soy sauce?

316
00:11:24,900 --> 00:11:26,060
I came in such a hurry.

317
00:11:26,060 --> 00:11:26,900
I didn't bring any.

318
00:11:27,420 --> 00:11:27,980
After all these days,

319
00:11:27,980 --> 00:11:29,180
my wife should be recovering by now.

320
00:11:29,460 --> 00:11:30,140
Go quickly.

321
00:11:30,140 --> 00:11:31,540
Bring her here with some soy sauce
to see me.

322
00:11:32,340 --> 00:11:32,860
Well...

323
00:11:33,140 --> 00:11:34,340
I don't want to lie to you.

324
00:11:34,780 --> 00:11:37,100
The truth is... your wife
is already dead.

325
00:11:37,340 --> 00:11:37,860
What?

326
00:11:38,540 --> 00:11:39,340
How did she die?

327
00:11:40,020 --> 00:11:42,580
Didn't you say last time that my wife
was only slightly injured?

328
00:11:42,980 --> 00:11:43,980
Without my wife,

329
00:11:43,980 --> 00:11:45,180
what's the point of me living?

330
00:11:45,380 --> 00:11:47,140
I'll kill myself and go find her
right now.

331
00:11:47,140 --> 00:11:48,260
Wait!

332
00:11:48,540 --> 00:11:49,860
She's not completely dead yet.

333
00:11:50,340 --> 00:11:51,740
She's in the Youming City.

334
00:11:51,740 --> 00:11:53,060
Youming City?

335
00:11:53,340 --> 00:11:53,980
My love...

336
00:11:53,980 --> 00:11:55,660
Wait for me. I'll save you
once I get out.

337
00:11:56,340 --> 00:11:57,020
My benefactor.

338
00:11:57,220 --> 00:11:58,740
Actually, she lied to you.

339
00:11:58,940 --> 00:12:00,540
She only wanted to trick you
into surviving the tribulation

340
00:12:00,940 --> 00:12:02,260
and enjoy a life of luxury with you.

341
00:12:02,780 --> 00:12:04,620
She told me all of this herself.

342
00:12:05,020 --> 00:12:07,500
She's with the guard
of the Youming City now.

343
00:12:07,500 --> 00:12:08,220
What?

344
00:12:09,020 --> 00:12:09,780
My benefactor.

345
00:12:09,980 --> 00:12:11,100
Don't be sad.

346
00:12:11,540 --> 00:12:12,620
You're such a good person.

347
00:12:12,620 --> 00:12:14,700
You'll surely find someone
who truly loves you.

348
00:12:16,780 --> 00:12:17,340
Hey.

349
00:12:17,860 --> 00:12:19,700
My benefactor, come down.

350
00:12:19,780 --> 00:12:20,340
Maybe

351
00:12:20,340 --> 00:12:22,260
someone forced her to say those things.

352
00:12:22,980 --> 00:12:23,540
That's right.

353
00:12:23,940 --> 00:12:25,900
Someone must have forced her
to say them.

354
00:12:26,900 --> 00:12:27,620
You're right.

355
00:12:28,020 --> 00:12:29,620
Find me another heart quickly.

356
00:12:29,780 --> 00:12:31,260
I need to get out and save my wife.

357
00:12:31,540 --> 00:12:33,660
The other woman is named Ke Ayao.

358
00:12:33,660 --> 00:12:35,140
She possesses a devoted heart.

359
00:12:35,140 --> 00:12:37,020
According to Lingyu,

360
00:12:37,180 --> 00:12:38,860
we have to wait until her love
becomes overwhelming

361
00:12:38,860 --> 00:12:40,020
before we can take out her heart.

362
00:12:40,740 --> 00:12:41,580
I asked around.

363
00:12:41,980 --> 00:12:43,900
- Ke Ayao is only one month old.
- What?

364
00:12:43,900 --> 00:12:45,660
My benefactor, please be patient.

365
00:12:45,940 --> 00:12:47,660
A decade or two will pass
in the blink of an eye.

366
00:12:48,060 --> 00:12:50,140
When Ke Ayao grows up,

367
00:12:50,140 --> 00:12:51,700
I'll take out her heart.

368
00:12:52,060 --> 00:12:53,380
A decade or two?

369
00:12:53,620 --> 00:12:55,980
By then, my wife might already
be a grandmother.

370
00:12:55,980 --> 00:12:56,660
Come on.

371
00:12:57,980 --> 00:12:59,820
My benefactor. Don't say this.

372
00:13:02,620 --> 00:13:03,260
Alas!

373
00:13:03,940 --> 00:13:05,180
Master.

374
00:13:05,180 --> 00:13:07,900
Please find a way to save Die.

375
00:13:08,700 --> 00:13:10,020
She's already dead.

376
00:13:10,020 --> 00:13:10,980
How can I save her?

377
00:13:10,980 --> 00:13:11,460
Alas!

378
00:13:13,100 --> 00:13:13,580
Wait!

379
00:13:14,220 --> 00:13:17,180
Weren't you close with the Lord
of Youming City?

380
00:13:17,380 --> 00:13:18,340
Then go ask him for help.

381
00:13:18,340 --> 00:13:19,340
- Come on.
- Go.

382
00:13:19,340 --> 00:13:20,580
Who said we're that close?

383
00:13:21,100 --> 00:13:21,820
Besides,

384
00:13:21,820 --> 00:13:23,260
I don't have any spiritual power now.

385
00:13:23,420 --> 00:13:25,780
Do you think that big-bearded guy
is just going to show up on his own?

386
00:13:25,780 --> 00:13:26,980
Unbelievable.

387
00:13:29,140 --> 00:13:29,580
Wow!

388
00:13:29,700 --> 00:13:31,100
Brother.

389
00:13:31,540 --> 00:13:32,260
Brother.

390
00:13:32,900 --> 00:13:33,340
Wow.

391
00:13:33,540 --> 00:13:34,740
What happened to your outfit?

392
00:13:34,740 --> 00:13:36,460
Did someone in your family pass away?

393
00:13:36,460 --> 00:13:37,260
Knock on wood.

394
00:13:37,260 --> 00:13:37,660
Oh?

395
00:13:38,180 --> 00:13:41,020
This is from the most famous
fashion store in the mortal world.

396
00:13:41,020 --> 00:13:43,900
The hottest item from Hermass.

397
00:13:43,900 --> 00:13:44,860
No taste.

398
00:13:45,340 --> 00:13:46,780
Fine, call me tasteless.

399
00:13:46,780 --> 00:13:48,420
But seriously, why are you dressed
like this?

400
00:13:48,420 --> 00:13:50,180
Well, I'll tell you the truth.

401
00:13:50,900 --> 00:13:52,260
For thousands of years,

402
00:13:52,260 --> 00:13:54,220
I've devoted myself to making
the Youming City thrive.

403
00:13:54,220 --> 00:13:54,740
Yeah.

404
00:13:54,740 --> 00:13:56,060
But looking back now,

405
00:13:56,060 --> 00:13:57,540
I'm still all alone.

406
00:13:57,540 --> 00:13:58,100
Oh.

407
00:13:58,100 --> 00:13:58,940
So,

408
00:13:59,300 --> 00:14:02,460
I thought I'd change my style
and get a new look.

409
00:14:02,460 --> 00:14:04,020
And I wanted to ask you

410
00:14:04,020 --> 00:14:05,740
if you know any beautiful ladies
I could meet.

411
00:14:05,740 --> 00:14:07,060
Oh, that's easy.

412
00:14:07,180 --> 00:14:07,540
Come on.

413
00:14:07,780 --> 00:14:08,380
Here you go.

414
00:14:09,940 --> 00:14:11,540
She's pretty good.

415
00:14:11,540 --> 00:14:13,660
But I don't go after girls
who haven't grown up yet.

416
00:14:28,220 --> 00:14:28,700
Miss.

417
00:14:28,700 --> 00:14:29,140
Look.

418
00:14:29,940 --> 00:14:31,780
I am the Lord of Youming City.

419
00:14:32,060 --> 00:14:33,340
May I ask your name?

420
00:14:33,820 --> 00:14:34,820
Oh, come on.

421
00:14:36,180 --> 00:14:37,500
Stop getting lovesick.

422
00:14:37,500 --> 00:14:39,100
Her son is already taller than you.

423
00:14:39,460 --> 00:14:40,780
She has a son?

424
00:14:40,780 --> 00:14:41,980
Even better.

425
00:14:42,140 --> 00:14:42,620
Come on.

426
00:14:42,620 --> 00:14:43,460
Can you be serious for once?

427
00:14:43,700 --> 00:14:44,540
- Let me ask you something.
- Huh?

428
00:14:44,660 --> 00:14:45,820
Her son

429
00:14:45,820 --> 00:14:47,420
and a girl named Lüdie,

430
00:14:47,420 --> 00:14:48,740
did they end up in your place?

431
00:14:48,740 --> 00:14:49,780
My place?

432
00:14:50,860 --> 00:14:51,660
- Let me check.
- Okay.

433
00:14:58,740 --> 00:14:59,300
Hey.

434
00:14:59,500 --> 00:15:00,260
- Ah?
- Wow.

435
00:15:00,260 --> 00:15:01,020
Die.

436
00:15:01,980 --> 00:15:04,820
You two...

437
00:15:07,100 --> 00:15:08,580
We just

438
00:15:08,900 --> 00:15:11,100
pledged ourselves to each other
in the Youming City.

439
00:15:11,100 --> 00:15:11,860
Wow.

440
00:15:16,900 --> 00:15:17,380
Mother.

441
00:15:18,300 --> 00:15:19,500
I'm back.

442
00:15:27,820 --> 00:15:28,900
So,

443
00:15:29,860 --> 00:15:31,660
this is your son.

444
00:15:33,620 --> 00:15:34,140
Hmm.

445
00:15:34,860 --> 00:15:36,180
Then he's family.

446
00:15:37,860 --> 00:15:38,380
Don't worry.

447
00:15:39,100 --> 00:15:41,060
Even though you no longer
have physical bodies,

448
00:15:41,660 --> 00:15:43,100
you're one of our own now.

449
00:15:44,100 --> 00:15:44,900
As your father... uh, no,

450
00:15:45,900 --> 00:15:46,900
as an elder...

451
00:15:48,300 --> 00:15:49,100
Here.

452
00:15:49,620 --> 00:15:52,180
The Youming City's Three Realms Pass.

453
00:15:52,460 --> 00:15:53,300
With this,

454
00:15:53,460 --> 00:15:54,500
you can travel through the Three Realms

455
00:15:54,700 --> 00:15:56,100
without any restrictions.

456
00:15:57,300 --> 00:15:58,180
Oh.

457
00:15:58,180 --> 00:15:59,460
I remember last time

458
00:15:59,460 --> 00:16:01,460
at that Rat Demon theme park,

459
00:16:01,460 --> 00:16:02,420
I waited for the swing ride

460
00:16:02,420 --> 00:16:04,620
for more than half an hour.

461
00:16:04,620 --> 00:16:06,820
Why didn't you give me this sooner?

462
00:16:07,140 --> 00:16:09,180
Because you didn't have the Express.

463
00:16:10,060 --> 00:16:10,820
Take it.

464
00:16:12,420 --> 00:16:12,860
Another day,

465
00:16:13,340 --> 00:16:15,060
I'll throw you a grand wedding.

466
00:16:15,060 --> 00:16:15,460
Huh?

467
00:16:15,980 --> 00:16:16,700
Where?

468
00:16:17,500 --> 00:16:18,220
Oh.

469
00:16:18,220 --> 00:16:20,940
At the Youming Everbright City,
of course.

470
00:16:20,940 --> 00:16:22,980
Mention my name and get 20% off.

471
00:16:24,060 --> 00:16:24,820
Holy Monk.

472
00:16:24,820 --> 00:16:25,180
Yes?

473
00:16:25,860 --> 00:16:27,820
A female devotee is here to see you.

474
00:16:28,020 --> 00:16:28,660
What?

475
00:16:29,100 --> 00:16:30,220
A female devotee?

476
00:16:30,420 --> 00:16:31,540
Female?

477
00:16:37,340 --> 00:16:40,390
♪My shoes are worn, my hat is torn♪

478
00:16:40,740 --> 00:16:43,590
♪Even my monk's robe is tattered♪

479
00:16:43,720 --> 00:16:47,390
♪Everything I own is worn and weathered♪

480
00:16:47,400 --> 00:16:50,470
♪Yet I laugh and live free as can be♪

481
00:16:50,880 --> 00:16:57,630
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

482
00:16:57,640 --> 00:17:01,190
♪With Buddha dwelling in my heart♪

483
00:17:07,880 --> 00:17:11,110
♪Once, I was known as Li Xiuyuan♪

484
00:17:11,120 --> 00:17:14,350
♪Now I bear the name Ji Dian♪

485
00:17:14,640 --> 00:17:17,670
♪After the wedding,
I became an immortal♪

486
00:17:17,680 --> 00:17:19,350
♪I thought of the Arhat
who subdued the tiger♪

487
00:17:19,360 --> 00:17:21,270
♪And there he was, right by my side,
oh my♪

488
00:17:21,280 --> 00:17:22,830
♪I left my wife behind♪

489
00:17:23,000 --> 00:17:24,430
♪And headed straight to Lingyin Temple♪

490
00:17:24,440 --> 00:17:28,270
♪Living a life of hiding here
and running there♪

491
00:17:28,280 --> 00:17:29,390
♪As long as thunder doesn't strike♪

492
00:17:29,400 --> 00:17:31,510
♪I still dare to make a solemn vow♪

493
00:17:31,520 --> 00:17:33,190
♪With me around, nothing can go wrong♪

494
00:17:33,200 --> 00:17:35,070
♪Waiter, bring me a plate
of chicken wings♪

495
00:17:35,080 --> 00:17:38,430
♪People laugh and say I'm lost
and foolish♪

496
00:17:38,440 --> 00:17:41,710
♪Guangliang always nags and scolds me♪

497
00:17:41,920 --> 00:17:44,830
♪His endless lectures come
from worry I'll cause trouble♪

498
00:17:44,840 --> 00:17:48,190
♪I say Buddha lives within my heart♪

499
00:17:48,200 --> 00:17:51,870
♪Wine and meat may pass through my body♪

500
00:17:51,880 --> 00:17:55,230
♪I wander around, I stroll along♪

501
00:17:55,240 --> 00:17:58,310
♪Leaving all my worries behind♪

502
00:17:58,880 --> 00:18:01,950
♪Take a sip, take a bite♪

503
00:18:01,960 --> 00:18:05,390
♪I don't overthink this life of mine♪

504
00:18:05,400 --> 00:18:08,950
♪You chase fame and fight
over fortune and fate♪

505
00:18:08,960 --> 00:18:12,430
♪You're just wasting your time♪

506
00:18:12,440 --> 00:18:15,390
♪They all call me a Living Buddha♪

507
00:18:15,400 --> 00:18:17,070
♪And I just laugh happily♪

508
00:18:17,080 --> 00:18:20,470
♪Wishing joy and happiness
for all in this world♪

509
00:18:29,160 --> 00:18:32,750
♪People laugh and say I'm lost
and foolish♪

510
00:18:32,760 --> 00:18:36,150
♪Guangliang always nags and scolds me♪

511
