519
00:19:03,280 --> 00:19:06,550
♪You're just wasting your time♪

520
00:19:06,720 --> 00:19:09,630
♪They all call me a Living Buddha♪

521
00:19:09,640 --> 00:19:11,270
♪And I just laugh happily♪

522
